== Effects ==
* Upon entering a room with enemies, spawns a [[Familiars#Locusts|Yellow Locust]] that deals double Isaac's damage and slows enemies.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc+|r+}} This trinket has a 1% chance to drop when defeating {{e|Famine}}.{{dlc-}}
* The Locust will also spawn each time a wave starts in {{R|Boss Rush}} and {{dlc|r+}} {{mode|greed|greedier}} [[Greed Mode]].

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Each copy will spawn one more locust.

